title: AlphaGo, move 37
youtube: JNrXgpSEEIE
caption: In game 2 against Lee Sedol, AlphaGo played move 37, a move DeepMind says had a 1 in 10,000 chance of being used.
source: AlphaGo
org: Google DeepMind
year: 2016
link: https://deepmind.google/research/alphago/
